@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@patientToken = {{loginPatient.response.body.token}}
@pharmacyToken = {{loginPharmacy.response.body.token}}

### 1. Obtener Branding público de Farmacia Dalton (esperado: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pharmacies/farmacia-dalton/branding
Accept: application/json

### 2. Login como Paciente — Camila (esperado: 200 OK)
# @name loginPatient
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "paciente@dalton.com.ar",
    "password": "paciente123"
}

### 3. Ver perfil autenticado de Camila (esperado: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### 4. Acceso a zona Paciente con token de Paciente (esperado: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patient/ping
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### 5. Acceso a zona Farmacia con token de Paciente (esperado: 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pharmacy/ping
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### 6. Login como Farmacia Dalton — B2B (esperado: 200 OK)
# @name loginPharmacy
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "farmacia@dalton.com.ar",
    "password": "dalton123"
}

### 7. Acceso a zona Farmacia con token de Farmacia (esperado: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pharmacy/ping
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacyToken}}

### 8. [B2B] Buscar paciente por código QR (esperado: 200 OK — Camila)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pharmacy/patients/lookup?q=APO-DAL-38456123
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacyToken}}

### 9. [B2B] Buscar paciente por DNI con puntos (esperado: 200 OK — Camila)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pharmacy/patients/lookup?q=38.456.123
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacyToken}}

### 10. [B2B] Acreditar puntos por compra de venta libre OTC de $15.500 ARS (esperado: 201 Created — +155 pts)
POST {{baseUrl}}/pharmacy/points/award
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacyToken}}

{
    "identifier": "APO-DAL-38456123",
    "amount_ars": 15500,
    "otc_confirmed": true,
    "notes": "Protector solar FPS 50 + limpiador facial"
}

### 11. [B2B] Intentar acreditar SIN confirmar venta libre OTC (esperado: 422 Unprocessable Entity)
POST {{baseUrl}}/pharmacy/points/award
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacyToken}}

{
    "identifier": "38456123",
    "amount_ars": 10000,
    "otc_confirmed": false
}

### 12. [B2B] Ver métricas del panel Farmacia (esperado: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pharmacy/dashboard
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacyToken}}

### 13. [B2C] Ver saldo e historial paginado de Camila (esperado: 200 OK — saldo actualizado a 505 pts)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patient/points
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}